      "body": "This PR addresses issue #532 by correcting the spectrum_2d function in neuralop/utils.py.\r\n\r\nThe changes include:\r\n- Using the L2-norm for wavenumber binning instead of the L1-norm.\r\n- Correcting the order of operations for power calculation by computing the squared magnitude before summing.\r\n\r\nThese modifications align the spectrum_2d function with standard methods for computing power spectra.\r\n\r\nCc: @vduruiss , @dhpitt ",
